  "2026-11-16T07:29:06.075Z",codex-sol,"Round K: PRRT_kwDOVLY-P863zl6f verified and fixed. The deadline inventory now recursively recognizes object/array/default/rest bindings, catch parameters, variable/function/class declarations and named expressions. Twenty shadowing forms each have a rejection control and a renamed binding control; property keys alone retain helper credit. Required gates passed through pm test: npm run typecheck; npm run lint; node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/review-close-contracts.test.ts test/coverage-aggregation.test.ts test/ci-routing.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts; git diff --check. Combined suite: 18 passed, zero failed/skipped. Tracking is disabled by project policy, so this comment records the successful execution receipt. No thread mutations. Releasing in progress for orchestrator verification."
